sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Act as Activity (foreground)
    participant Svc as DownloadFGS (dataSync)
    participant Notif as NotificationManager
    participant Store as storage (Ch 18)

    User->>Act: start download
    Act->>Svc: startForegroundService(intent)
    Svc->>Svc: startForeground(id, notif, DATA_SYNC) within window
    Svc->>Notif: show progress notification
    Svc->>Store: download chunks (Ch 18)
    Svc->>Notif: update progress
    Store-->>Svc: complete
    Svc->>Svc: stopForeground + stopSelf
    Svc->>Notif: dismiss / show complete
